    "title": "20 dogs rescued in Georgetown County dogfighting warrant operation, sheriff's office says - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By ABC NEWS 4 STAFF ,\n11 hours ago GEORGETOWN COUNTY, S.C. (WCIV) — Authorities rescued 20 dogs in “varying states of malnourishment and neglect” during a dogfighting-related search warrant operation in Georgetown County on Thursday, according to the Georgetown County Sheriff’s Office. The sheriff’s office said its Investigations, Street Crimes and Narcotics divisions assisted... Read full article\n2",
